cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research record, its data or its benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "BOAR research record: an offline phone research assistant measured against 'half as good as internet plus a frontier AI' (full open record, v1.1.2)"
abstract: >-
  The full research record of BOAR, an offline Android research assistant built for poidh bounty #31:
  frozen pass/fail criteria, arm reports, aggregates, traces, pack builders, decision queue and closed negative
  results (387 experiments), published as one commit per release (earlier releases remain in history). The bar ("more than 50 %
  as good as internet plus a frontier AI", at most 12 GB RAM, English) was not reached: on a Pixel 8a in airplane mode
  the submitted app won 0 of 71 head-to-heads under two judge families (ruler U-total 0.165 under Claude Opus,
  0.242 under OpenAI gpt-5.6-sol via the Codex CLI). Health material is AI-reviewed, not clinically reviewed.
authors:
